---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "About — Family-Owned in Buda Since 1998"
description: "Research Turf Management is owner Gye Hutson's family-run landscape company — an Austin native serving Central Texas since 1998. Meet the crew behind the work."
---
{% import "partials/icons.njk" as ico %}
{% import "partials/scene.njk" as scn %}
{% import "partials/photo.njk" as photo %}

<section class="hero hero--page">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero__inner">
      <p class="hero__tagline">Family-owned &amp; locally operated</p>
      <h1>The crew Central Texas has trusted since 1998</h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">Not a franchise. Not a call center. A local, family-run company that treats every yard like its own.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<nav class="wrap crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>About</nav>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our story</p>
      <h2>Born and raised in Central Texas</h2>
      <p class="lead">Owner Gye Hutson grew up in Austin near Lake Travis — Leander High School, then Austin Community College, then Southwestern University in Georgetown. He's spent his whole life in Central Texas, and it shows in the work.</p>
      <p>In {{ site.parentFounded }}, Gye started the family business in South Austin. As the landscaping and turf side grew into serious design-build work, it earned its own name — <strong>Research Turf Management</strong>, launched in {{ site.founded }}, the same year the company earned its BBB accreditation. Today both sides of the business run out of one warehouse in Buda, with the same office team and the same crews.</p>
      <p>That local knowledge is the whole point. Gye knows Central Texas soil, Central Texas heat, and Central Texas drought firsthand — so the landscapes we design are built to actually thrive here, not just look good on install day.</p>

      <h3>Our philosophy</h3>
      <blockquote class="review" style="font-style:italic">
        We treat every home as if it were our own — and every customer, including their four-legged family members, like neighbors.
      </blockquote>
      <p>Family and pet safety is the throughline in everything we do. It's why customers stay with us for 13, 20, even 30 years — and why they refer their neighbors.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <figure class="media media--tall reveal">
        {{ photo.image("lawn", "A Research Turf Management landscape in Buda, TX") }}
        <span class="media__label">Family-owned in Buda, TX</span>
      </figure>
      <div class="badges" style="margin-top:22px">
        <span class="badge">{{ ico.svg("star") }} 5.0★ Google</span>
        <span class="badge">{{ ico.svg("shield") }} BBB {{ site.trust.bbbRating }}</span>
        <span class="badge">{{ ico.svg("award") }} Since {{ site.parentFounded }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Timeline -->
<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow" style="margin:0 auto 40px">
      <p class="eyebrow">The journey</p>
      <h2>28 years, one family, one community</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-4">
      <div class="card"><div class="stat__n">{{ site.parentFounded }}</div><h3 style="margin-top:8px">The beginning</h3><p class="muted">The family business opens in South Austin.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="stat__n">{{ site.founded }}</div><h3 style="margin-top:8px">Research Turf</h3><p class="muted">The landscaping division earns its own name — and BBB accreditation.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="stat__n">Today</div><h3 style="margin-top:8px">Buda HQ</h3><p class="muted">Both brands operate from one warehouse with shared crews.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="stat__n">5.0★</div><h3 style="margin-top:8px">Still earning it</h3><p class="muted">A perfect rating and customers who've stayed for decades.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Team -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow" style="margin:0 auto 40px">
      <p class="eyebrow">Meet the team</p>
      <h2>The people behind the work</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-2" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto">
      <div class="card center">
        <div class="card__icon" style="margin:0 auto 16px;width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%">{{ ico.svg("compass") }}</div>
        <h3>{{ site.owner.name }}</h3>
        <p class="muted">{{ site.owner.title }}</p>
        <p>Austin native, lifelong Central Texan, and the designer behind every project. Gye leads with the belief that your yard should be treated like his own.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card center">
        <div class="card__icon" style="margin:0 auto 16px;width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%">{{ ico.svg("mail") }}</div>
        <h3>{{ site.officeManager.name }}</h3>
        <p class="muted">{{ site.officeManager.title }}</p>
        <p>The voice you'll hear when you call — customers name-check Megan in their reviews for keeping everything running smoothly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Sister company -->
<section class="section section--pest">
  <div class="wrap center narrow" style="margin:0 auto">
    <p class="eyebrow">Two brands, one family</p>
    <h2>Also need pest control?</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="color:var(--dark-ink)">Our sister company, {{ site.sister.name }}, handles pest control, termite letters for home closings, rodent exclusion and lawn-pest treatment — with the same family, the same crews, and the same standards. Many of our customers use both.</p>
    <a class="btn btn--white btn--lg" href="{{ site.sister.url }}" rel="noopener">Visit Excel Pest &amp; Lawn Control {{ ico.svg("arrow") }}</a>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
